  "title": "WSDG: add #.IMPORT to Conformance Files documentation",
  "description": "Even though lots of files from `epan/dissectors/asn/**/*.cnf` use `#.IMPORT` instead of `#.INCLUDE`, there is no mention of `#.IMPORT` in the whole WSDG. `tools/asn2wrs.py` behaves the same for both tags, meaning that the behavior of the script is the same, thus WSDG gets extended with the `#.IMPORT` description.",
